{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PreparedGame","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bootstrap.build"},{"type":"text","text":" is a pure function of the game "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"type","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Game.init()"},{"type":"text","text":" takes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no input, every declaration is reflected from the type, and the random seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is applied per world afterward — never baked into the definition or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pristine state. Its dominant cost is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mirror"},{"type":"text","text":" reflection over the game and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every content bundle. Preparing a game once and seeding many worlds from it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"therefore pays that cost a single time; each world copies the value-type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"definition and state and applies its own seed. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", so a prepared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game is safe to share across concurrently-running worlds."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/preparedgame"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/PreparedGame","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationsh